# Toolchain & Project Structure

## Language

**C11** (`-std=c11`). **No C++.**

## Compiler flags (from `Makefile`)

std=c11 -Wall -Wextra -Wpedantic -Werror
-D_POSIX_C_SOURCE=200809L
-Iinclude
-O2 # release

Debug target adds `-g -O1 -fsanitize=address,undefined -fno-omit-frame-pointer`.

## Compiler selection

`Makefile` picks **gcc** if available, else **clang**:

```makefile
CC := $(shell command -v gcc >/dev/null 2>&1 && echo gcc || echo clang)
```

## Build system

**GNU Make** at repo root. Single link step for the main binary (no separate `.o` rules).

| Target | Output |
|--------|--------|
| `make` / `all` | `build/rm-toto` (`build/rm-toto.exe` on Windows) |
| `make debug` | `build/rm-toto-debug` |
| `make test` | builds + runs `build/tests/test_core` |
| `make clean` | removes `build/rm-toto`, `build/rm-toto-debug`, `build/tests/test_core` (and `.exe` variants) |
| `make install` | `install -m 755 build/rm-toto /usr/local/bin/rm-toto` (Linux/macOS; needs sudo) |

**Main sources:** `src/main.c`, `src/rm_toto_emit.c`, `src/rm_toto_walk.c`, `src/rm_toto_prompt.c`, `src/rm_toto_cli.c`

**Test sources:** `tests/test_runner.c`, `tests/test_join_path_basic.c`, `tests/test_join_path_truncation.c`, `tests/test_join_path_trailing_slash.c`, `tests/test_join_path_empty_name.c`, `tests/test_is_root_path.c`

## Dependencies

**libc only** — no extra `-l` flags. POSIX headers: `dirent.h`, `sys/stat.h`, `unistd.h`, etc.

